    "text": "<p>The total number of chiral compound/s from the following is</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a5ecbf5a-39aa-44ce-83f9-e2aef261d27c-9896613.png\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 686px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Following points are to be remembered when checking for chirality in a compound:<br />1.Compound should have a stereogenic centre.<br />2. Compound shouldn&#39;t have any plane&nbsp;of symmetry as it can convert a chiral compound to a meso compound.<br />Based on the above two facts, out of the following, only 2 are chiral compounds:<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/644e888e-35bc-40dd-b999-de28b6d2e622-9896613_2.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 232px;\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/2d8fcef1-56bd-4dab-93ef-2a5bcb4f6533-9896613_3.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 273px;\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/5a6b0538-8888-4d80-8129-c25c823b8953-9896613_4.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 286px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
